# Code owners for gwlint. GitHub requests a review from the matching owner
# when a pull request touches these paths. Later rules win over earlier ones,
# so the catch-all comes first.

# Everything, unless a rule below is more specific.
*                           @sdOps

# Dependency pins. go.mod carries replace directives holding k8s.io/* and helm
# down to the versions kube-linter v0.8.3 itself compiles against; moving them
# breaks the build in ways the README explains at length. Changes here deserve
# a real look, not a rubber stamp.
/go.mod                     @sdOps
/go.sum                     @sdOps

# Suppressed vulnerability findings. Each entry claims a CVE is unreachable
# from gwlint; a wrong claim here is worse than no allowlist at all.
/.govulncheck-allowlist     @sdOps
/scripts/vulncheck.sh       @sdOps

# CI and lint policy: what "green" means for every other change.
/.github/                   @sdOps
/.golangci.yml              @sdOps
/mise.toml                  @sdOps
